# Two products

Strength (`apps/athlete/`) and The Engine (`apps/engine/`) are **separate
products**. Do not mix loggers, storage keys, or Library CTAs.

- Strength = kg/reps TRACK, `THE-brain-v1`, silent `PlanSync`.
- Engine = splits/watts/RPM, `THE-hybrid-engine-v1`, `@hybrid/adaptive` cond APIs.
- Do not put Engine UI in the Strength app. Do not create `apps/hybrid-engine/`.
